  "steps": [
    "Crush the coconut, green chilli, garlic, cumin seeds and turmeric together roughly without adding water.",
    "Heat the coconut oil in a wide pan and crackle the mustard seeds.",
    "Add the dried red chilli, curry leaves and onion and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the shredded cabbage and salt and toss on medium heat for 3 minutes.",
    "Add the coconut mixture, mix well, cover and cook for 5 minutes until the cabbage is tender but still crunchy.",
    "Uncover, stir on high heat for a minute to dry out any moisture and serve."
  ]
